  'help.security-declaration.summary': 'Every shop, hub, fleet and rider in no fleet signs a short security declaration: how they keep what is in their care. It is signed when they join and again every year. Without one in force, nothing new is taken on — what is already in their hands is finished as usual.',
  'help.security-declaration.step1': 'Shop app, Hub app, Fleet app or Driver app: on the home screen, the declaration — a handful of promises. Read them and press “I declare this — sign”. It is signed in your name, today, for a year.',
