  'help.security-declaration.note1': 'A fleet’s drivers sign nothing of their own: the fleet signs, and answers for them. At a shop, the owner signs — not the people at the counter.',
  // new-partner-limit
  'help.new-partner-limit.title': 'The limit for a new shop or rider',
  'help.new-partner-limit.summary': 'Where your country’s company has set one, a new shop holds at most so many parcels at once, and a new rider in no fleet carries at most so many. The limit grows with every parcel you hand on, and goes once you have handed on enough.',
  'help.new-partner-limit.step1': 'Shop app: the home screen says how many parcels you hold, your limit now, and how it grows. At your limit a parcel is refused at take-in, and the screen says why.',
