  'help.new-partner-limit.step4': 'A bicycle or motorcycle rider in no fleet: until SeeBuyGet has seen a photo of your ID, your limit stays where it starts. Driver app, home screen: “Send a photo of your ID”. You are told when it has been seen — from then it grows as above — or why not, and you send another.',
