  'help.mute-account.note1': 'While your account is muted, a shop of yours is not offered for new parcels and leaves the map, you are offered no loads as a driver, your fleet takes no new work, and your store takes no new orders. What you already hold goes on, and a sort hub keeps sorting what the network sends it.',
  'help.mute-account.note2': 'Sign-in codes and messages about your account’s safety still reach you. Other notifications go to the list in the app without ringing your phone, and other emails are not sent.',
  'help.mute-account.note3': 'Muting covers every role on your account at once: your account is your phone number, and your roles are what you do with it.',
  'help.change-pin.title': 'Change your PIN',
  'help.change-pin.summary': 'Your PIN is 5 digits. Change it with the current one — or, if you have forgotten it, with a code sent to your phone.',
