  'help.change-pin.note6': 'We write to your recovery email, and tell you in the app, whenever your PIN is replaced or starts working on a new phone or browser. If it was not you, replace your PIN straight away: that shuts out every other phone and browser.',
  'help.change-pin.note7': '“Settings › Phones and browsers” shows every phone and browser your PIN works on, with when each was confirmed and last used. “Forget all the others” asks for your PIN and signs you out everywhere; each of the others then needs a code to your number before your PIN works there again. On a phone or a computer that is not yours, use “Sign out, and forget this one”.',
  // who-you-contract-with
  'help.who-you-contract-with.title': 'Who you contract with',
  'help.who-you-contract-with.summary': 'Settings shows the SeeBuyGet company you contract with and the licences and insurance it trades on, each with its number. If one is not right, you can say so.',
  'help.who-you-contract-with.step1': 'Open “Settings › Who you contract with”. Shop, Hub, Driver, Fleet and Store app: tap your picture, then Settings. Business app: Settings.',
